    {
      "id": "text-366",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3010,
      "width": 1224.3000000000002,
      "height": 122.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2898354,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 38330814,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reference: briareus-windows (app/main.c layout, screen_projects.c, screen_conversation.c, screen_panel.c). Other clients match this structure.\nWindows · Mac: as drawn. Header buttons collapse to 32px icon squares when they would leave the title under 120px. ⧉ pops the conversation into its own window.\nCtrl+F opens the find bar under the header: Find in conversation · N / M · Previous · Next · Close.\nWindows: 🌐 Browser docks as a column in the panel’s place (default 45% of the main area, draggable divider).\niPad: wide layout (split view). iPhone: narrow flow only; the session details open as a sheet over the conversation.\nQuest: list beside conversation as separate panels; no details panel — the pull request opens in a browser panel.\nRegion names (sidebar, canvas, raise, sunken) are the theme.* roles; widths and margins are layout.* in tokens/. Greys only, on purpose.",
      "originalText": "Reference: briareus-windows (app/main.c layout, screen_projects.c, screen_conversation.c, screen_panel.c). Other clients match this structure.\nWindows · Mac: as drawn. Header buttons collapse to 32px icon squares when they would leave the title under 120px. ⧉ pops the conversation into its own window.\nCtrl+F opens the find bar under the header: Find in conversation · N / M · Previous · Next · Close.\nWindows: 🌐 Browser docks as a column in the panel’s place (default 45% of the main area, draggable divider).\niPad: wide layout (split view). iPhone: narrow flow only; the session details open as a sheet over the conversation.\nQuest: list beside conversation as separate panels; no details panel — the pull request opens in a browser panel.\nRegion names (sidebar, canvas, raise, sunken) are the theme.* roles; widths and margins are layout.* in tokens/. Greys only, on purpose.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
